Well, the connectives issue is, as far as I'm aware, that there's too many
of them, and some are very poorly defined- we don't know exactly how they
interact.

I believe .xorxes. created a proposal that addressed the first issue at
least. I remember reading it, and deciding that I rather liked the idea.
Let me see if I can find it, I know it's on the Lojban site.


